sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to request the Charging Station to stop the ongoing transaction

    CSMS->>CS: RequestStopTransactionRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must equal the transactionId<br>provided by the Test System in before state

    CS-->>CSMS: RequestStopTransactionResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = RemoteStop, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = Remote, eventType = Ended)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
